{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09516","headline":"即席赋露中菊 · 刘湾","name":"即席赋露中菊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衆芳春竞发，寒菊露偏滋。\n受气何曾异，开花独自迟。\n晚成犹有分，欲采未过时。\n勿弃东篱下，看随秋草衰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘湾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09516.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09516","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}